{"suttaId":"thi-ap18","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7804,8088],"vripara":"289"},"segments":{"thi-ap18:0.3":"Khemātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap18:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammesu cakkhumā;","thi-ap18:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap18:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātā seṭṭhikule ahuṃ [ahu (syā.)];","thi-ap18:2.3":"Nānāratanapajjote, mahāsukhasamappitā.","thi-ap18:3.1":"“Upetvā taṃ mahāvīraṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ;","thi-ap18:3.3":"Tato jātappasādāhaṃ, upemi saraṇaṃ jinaṃ.","thi-ap18:4.1":"“Mātaraṃ pitaraṃ cāhaṃ, āyācitvā vināyakaṃ;","thi-ap18:4.3":"Nimantayitvā sattāhaṃ, bhojayiṃ sahasāvakaṃ.","thi-ap18:5.1":"“Atikkante ca sattāhe, mahāpaññānamuttamaṃ;","thi-ap18:5.3":"Bhikkhuniṃ etadaggamhi, ṭhapesi narasārathi.","thi-ap18:6.1":"“Taṃ sutvā muditā hutvā, puno tassa mahesino;","thi-ap18:6.3":"Kāraṃ katvāna taṃ ṭhānaṃ, paṇipacca paṇīdahiṃ.","thi-ap18:7.1":"“Tato mama jino [maṃ sa jino (syā.)] āha,‘sijjhataṃ paṇidhī tava;","thi-ap18:7.3":"Sasaṅghe me kataṃ kāraṃ, appameyyaphalaṃ tayā.","thi-ap18:8.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap18:8.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap18:9.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap18:9.3":"Etadaggamanuppattā, khemā nāma bhavissati’.","thi-ap18:10.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap18:10.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsūpagā ahaṃ.","thi-ap18:11.1":"“Tato cutā yāmamagaṃ, tatohaṃ tusitaṃ gatā;","thi-ap18:11.3":"Tato ca nimmānaratiṃ, vasavattipuraṃ tato.","thi-ap18:12.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapajjāmi, tassa kammassa vāhasā;","thi-ap18:12.3":"Tattha tattheva rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap18:13.1":"“Tato cutā manussatte, rājūnaṃ cakkavattinaṃ;","thi-ap18:13.3":"Maṇḍalīnañca rājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap18:14.1":"“Sampattiṃ anubhotvāna, devesu manujesu ca;","thi-ap18:14.3":"Sabbattha sukhitā hutvā, nekakappesu saṃsariṃ.","thi-ap18:15.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī lokanāyako;","thi-ap18:15.3":"Uppajji cārudassano [cārunayano (sī. pī.)], sabbadhammavipassako.","thi-ap18:16.1":"“Tamahaṃ lokanāyakaṃ, upetvā narasārathiṃ;","thi-ap18:16.3":"Dhammaṃ bhaṇitaṃ sutvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap18:17.1":"“Dasavassasahassāni, tassa vīrassa sāsane;","thi-ap18:17.3":"Brahmacariyaṃ caritvāna, yuttayogā bahussutā.","thi-ap18:18.1":"“Paccayākārakusalā, catusaccavisāradā;","thi-ap18:18.3":"Nipuṇā cittakathikā, satthusāsanakārikā.","thi-ap18:19.1":"“Tato cutāhaṃ tusitaṃ, upapannā yasassinī;","thi-ap18:19.3":"Abhibhomi tahiṃ aññe, brahmacārīphalenahaṃ.","thi-ap18:20.1":"“Yattha yatthūpapannāhaṃ, mahābhogā mahaddhanā;","thi-ap18:20.3":"Medhāvinī sīlavatī [rūpavatī (sī. syā. pī.)], vinītaparisāpi ca.","thi-ap18:21.1":"“Bhavāmi tena kammena, yogena jinasāsane;","thi-ap18:21.3":"Sabbā sampattiyo mayhaṃ, sulabhā manaso piyā.","thi-ap18:22.1":"“Yopi me bhavate bhattā, yattha yattha gatāyapi;","thi-ap18:22.3":"Vimāneti na maṃ koci, paṭipattibalena me.","thi-ap18:23.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap18:23.3":"Nāmena koṇāgamano, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap18:24.1":"“Tadā hi bārāṇasiyaṃ, susamiddhakulappajā [susamiddhi …(syā.)];","thi-ap18:24.3":"Dhanañjānī sumedhā ca, ahampi ca tayo janā.","thi-ap18:25.1":"“Saṅghārāmamadāsimha, dānasahāyikā pure [neke sahassike mune (syā.), dānaṃ sahassikaṃ mune (pī.)];","thi-ap18:25.3":"Saṅghassa ca vihārampi [sasaṃghassa vihāraṃ hi (syā. pī.)], uddissa kārikā [dāyikā (pī.)] mayaṃ.","thi-ap18:26.1":"“Tato cutā mayaṃ sabbā, tāvatiṃsūpagā ahuṃ;","thi-ap18:26.3":"Yasasā aggataṃ pattā, manussesu tatheva ca.","thi-ap18:27.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappamhi, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap18:27.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap18:28.1":"“Upaṭṭhāko mahesissa, tadā āsi narissaro;","thi-ap18:28.3":"Kāsirājā kikī nāma, bārāṇasipuruttame.","thi-ap18:29.1":"“Tassāsiṃ jeṭṭhikā dhītā, samaṇī iti vissutā;","thi-ap18:29.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvā jinaggassa, pabbajjaṃ samarocayiṃ.","thi-ap18:30.1":"“Anujāni na no tāto, agāreva tadā mayaṃ;","thi-ap18:30.3":"Vīsavassasahassāni, vicarimha atanditā.","thi-ap18:31.1":"“Komāribrahmacariyaṃ, rājakaññā sukhedhitā;","thi-ap18:31.3":"Buddhopaṭṭhānaniratā, muditā satta dhītaro.","thi-ap18:32.1":"“Samaṇī samaṇaguttā ca, bhikkhunī bhikkhudāyikā;","thi-ap18:32.3":"Dhammā ceva sudhammā ca, sattamī saṅghadāyikā.","thi-ap18:33.1":"“Ahaṃ uppalavaṇṇā ca, paṭācārā ca kuṇḍalā;","thi-ap18:33.3":"Kisāgotamī dhammadinnā, visākhā hoti sattamī.","thi-ap18:34.1":"“Kadāci so narādicco, dhammaṃ desesi abbhutaṃ;","thi-ap18:34.3":"Mahānidānasuttantaṃ, sutvā taṃ pariyāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap18:35.1":"“Tehi kammehi sukatehi, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap18:35.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap18:36.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, sākalāya puruttame;","thi-ap18:36.3":"Rañño maddassa dhītāmhi, manāpā dayitā piyā.","thi-ap18:37.1":"“Saha me jātamattamhi, khemaṃ tamhi pure ahu;","thi-ap18:37.3":"Tato khemāti nāmaṃ me, guṇato upapajjatha.","thi-ap18:38.1":"“Yadāhaṃ yobbanaṃ pattā, rūpalāvaññabhūsitā [rūpavaṇṇavibhūsitā (syā.), rūpavantā vibhūsitā (pī.), rūpavilāsabhūsitā (ka.)];","thi-ap18:38.3":"Tadā adāsi maṃ tāto, bimbisārassa rājino.","thi-ap18:39.1":"“Tassāhaṃ suppiyā āsiṃ, rūpake lāyane ratā;","thi-ap18:39.3":"Rūpānaṃ dosavādīti, na upesiṃ mahādayaṃ.","thi-ap18:40.1":"“Bimbisāro tadā rājā, mamānuggahabuddhiyā;","thi-ap18:40.3":"Vaṇṇayitvā veḷuvanaṃ, gāyake gāpayī mamaṃ.","thi-ap18:41.1":"“Rammaṃ veḷuvanaṃ yena, na diṭṭhaṃ sugatālayaṃ;","thi-ap18:41.3":"Na tena nandanaṃ diṭṭhaṃ, iti maññāmase mayaṃ.","thi-ap18:42.1":"“Yena veḷuvanaṃ diṭṭhaṃ, naranandananandanaṃ;","thi-ap18:42.3":"Sudiṭṭhaṃ nandanaṃ tena, amarindasunandanaṃ.","thi-ap18:43.1":"“Vihāya nandanaṃ devā, otaritvā mahītalaṃ [mahītale (syā. pī.)];","thi-ap18:43.3":"Rammaṃ veḷuvanaṃ disvā, na tappanti suvimhitā.","thi-ap18:44.1":"“Rājapuññena nibbattaṃ, buddhapuññena bhūsitaṃ;","thi-ap18:44.3":"Ko vattā tassa nissesaṃ, vanassa guṇasañcayaṃ.","thi-ap18:45.1":"“Taṃ sutvā vanasamiddhaṃ, mama sotamanoharaṃ;","thi-ap18:45.3":"Daṭṭhukāmā tamuyyānaṃ, rañño ārocayiṃ tadā.","thi-ap18:46.1":"“Mahatā parivārena, tadā ca so [tadā maṃ so (syā. pī.)] mahīpati;","thi-ap18:46.3":"Maṃ pesesi [saṃpesesi (syā.), sampāpesi (pī.)] tamuyyānaṃ, dassanāya samussukaṃ.","thi-ap18:47.1":"“Gaccha passa mahābhoge, vanaṃ nettarasāyanaṃ;","thi-ap18:47.3":"Yaṃ sadā bhāti siriyā, sugatābhānurañjitaṃ.","thi-ap18:48.1":"“Yadā ca piṇḍāya muni, giribbajapuruttamaṃ;","thi-ap18:48.3":"Paviṭṭhohaṃ tadāyeva, vanaṃ daṭṭhumupāgamiṃ.","thi-ap18:49.1":"“Tadā taṃ phullavipinaṃ, nānābhamarakūjitaṃ;","thi-ap18:49.3":"Kokilāgītasahitaṃ, mayūragaṇanaccitaṃ.","thi-ap18:50.1":"“Appasaddamanākiṇṇaṃ, nānācaṅkamabhūsitaṃ;","thi-ap18:50.3":"Kuṭimaṇḍapasaṅkiṇṇaṃ, yogīvaravirājitaṃ.","thi-ap18:51.1":"“Vicarantī amaññissaṃ, saphalaṃ nayanaṃ mama;","thi-ap18:51.3":"Tatthāpi taruṇaṃ bhikkhuṃ, yuttaṃ disvā vicintayiṃ.","thi-ap18:52.1":"“‘Īdise vipine ramme, ṭhitoyaṃ navayobbane;","thi-ap18:52.3":"Vasantamiva kantena, rūpena ca samanvito.","thi-ap18:53.1":"“‘Nisinno rukkhamūlamhi, muṇḍo saṅghāṭipāruto;","thi-ap18:53.3":"Jhāyate vatayaṃ bhikkhu, hitvā visayajaṃ ratiṃ.","thi-ap18:54.1":"“‘Nanu nāma gahaṭṭhena, kāmaṃ bhutvā yathāsukhaṃ;","thi-ap18:54.3":"Pacchā jiṇṇena dhammoyaṃ, caritabbo subhaddako’.","thi-ap18:55.1":"“Suññakanti viditvāna, gandhagehaṃ jinālayaṃ;","thi-ap18:55.3":"Upetvā jinamaddakkhaṃ, udayantaṃva bhākaraṃ.","thi-ap18:56.1":"“Ekakaṃ sukhamāsīnaṃ, bījamānaṃ varitthiyā;","thi-ap18:56.3":"Disvānevaṃ vicintesiṃ, nāyaṃ lūkho narāsabho.","thi-ap18:57.1":"“Sā kaññā kanakābhāsā, padumānanalocanā;","thi-ap18:57.3":"Bimboṭṭhī kundadasanā, manonettarasāyanā.","thi-ap18:58.1":"“Hemadolābhasavanā [hemadolā suvadīnā (syā.)], kalikākārasutthanī [kalasākārasuttanī (sī. pī.), kamalākārasuttanī (syā.)];","thi-ap18:58.3":"Vedimajjhāva sussoṇī [kanumajjhāva sussoṇī (sī.), vedimajjhā varasoṇī (syā. pī.)], rambhoru cārubhūsanā.","thi-ap18:59.1":"“Rattaṃsakupasaṃbyānā, nīlamaṭṭhanivāsanā;","thi-ap18:59.3":"Atappaneyyarūpena, hāsabhāvasamanvitā [hāvabhāvasamanvitā (sī.), sabbābharaṇamaṇḍitā (syā.)].","thi-ap18:60.1":"“Disvā tamevaṃ cintesiṃ, ahoyamabhirūpinī;","thi-ap18:60.3":"Na mayānena nettena, diṭṭhapubbā kudācanaṃ.","thi-ap18:61.1":"“Tato jarābhibhūtā sā, vivaṇṇā vikatānanā;","thi-ap18:61.3":"Bhinnadantā setasirā, salālā vadanāsuci.","thi-ap18:62.1":"“Saṅkhittakaṇṇā setakkhī, lambāsubhapayodharā;","thi-ap18:62.3":"Valivitatasabbaṅgī, sirāvitatadehinī.","thi-ap18:63.1":"“Nataṅgā daṇḍadutiyā, upphāsulikatā [uppaṇḍupaṇḍukā (sī. syā.)] kisā;","thi-ap18:63.3":"Pavedhamānā patitā, nissasantī muhuṃ muhuṃ.","thi-ap18:64.1":"“Tato me āsi saṃvego, abbhuto lomahaṃsano;","thi-ap18:64.3":"Dhiratthu rūpaṃ asuciṃ, ramante yattha bālisā.","thi-ap18:65.1":"“Tadā mahākāruṇiko, disvā saṃviggamānasaṃ;","thi-ap18:65.3":"Udaggacitto sugato, imā gāthā abhāsatha.","thi-ap18:66.1":"“‘Āturaṃ asuciṃ pūtiṃ, passa kheme samussayaṃ;","thi-ap18:66.3":"Uggharantaṃ paggharantaṃ, bālānaṃ abhinanditaṃ.","thi-ap18:67.1":"“‘Asubhāya cittaṃ bhāvehi, ekaggaṃ susamāhitaṃ;","thi-ap18:67.3":"Sati kāyagatā tyatthu, nibbidā bahulā bhava.","thi-ap18:68.1":"“‘Yathā idaṃ tathā etaṃ, yathā etaṃ tathā idaṃ;","thi-ap18:68.3":"Ajjhattañca bahiddhā ca, kāye chandaṃ virājaya.","thi-ap18:69.1":"“‘Animittañca bhāvehi, mānānusayamujjaha;","thi-ap18:69.3":"Tato mānābhisamayā, upasantā carissasi.","thi-ap18:70.1":"“‘Ye rāgarattānupatanti sotaṃ, sayaṃ kataṃ makkaṭakova jālaṃ;","thi-ap18:70.3":"Etampi chetvāna paribbajanti, na pekkhino [anapekkhino (sī. syā. pī.)] kāmasukhaṃ pahāya’.","thi-ap18:71.1":"“Tato kallitacittaṃ [kallikacittaṃ (syā.), kalikacittaṃ (pī.)] maṃ, ñatvāna narasārathi;","thi-ap18:71.3":"Mahānidānaṃ desesi, suttantaṃ vinayāya me.","thi-ap18:72.1":"“Sutvā suttantaseṭṭhaṃ taṃ, pubbasaññamanussariṃ;","thi-ap18:72.3":"Tattha ṭhitāvahaṃ santī, dhammacakkhuṃ visodhayiṃ.","thi-ap18:73.1":"“Nipatitvā mahesissa, pādamūlamhi tāvade;","thi-ap18:73.3":"Accayaṃ desanatthāya, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap18:74.1":"“‘Namo te sabbadassāvī, namo te karuṇākara;","thi-ap18:74.3":"Namo te tiṇṇasaṃsāra, namo te amataṃ dada.","thi-ap18:75.1":"“‘Diṭṭhigahanapakkhandā [… pakkhantā (sī. syā.)], kāmarāgavimohitā;","thi-ap18:75.3":"Tayā sammā upāyena, vinītā vinaye ratā.","thi-ap18:76.1":"“‘Adassanena vibhogā [vibbhogā (sī.), vihitā (syā.)], tādisānaṃ mahesinaṃ;","thi-ap18:76.3":"Anubhonti mahādukkhaṃ, sattā saṃsārasāgare.","thi-ap18:77.1":"“‘Yadāhaṃ lokasaraṇaṃ, araṇaṃ araṇantaguṃ [maraṇantagaṃ (syā.)];","thi-ap18:77.3":"Nāddasāmi adūraṭṭhaṃ, desayāmi [desessāmi (syā.)] tamaccayaṃ.","thi-ap18:78.1":"“‘Mahāhitaṃ varadadaṃ, ahitoti visaṅkitā;","thi-ap18:78.3":"Nopesiṃ rūpaniratā, desayāmi tamaccayaṃ’.","thi-ap18:79.1":"“Tadā madhuranigghoso, mahākāruṇiko jino;","thi-ap18:79.3":"Avoca tiṭṭha khemeti, siñcanto amatena maṃ.","thi-ap18:80.1":"“Tadā paṇamya sirasā, katvā ca naṃ padakkhiṇaṃ;","thi-ap18:80.3":"Gantvā disvā narapatiṃ, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ.","thi-ap18:81.1":"“‘Aho sammā upāyo te, cintitoyamarindama;","thi-ap18:81.3":"Vanadassanakāmāya, diṭṭho nibbānato muni.","thi-ap18:82.1":"“‘Yadi te ruccate rāja [rājā (syā.)], sāsane tassa tādino;","thi-ap18:82.3":"Pabbajissāmi rūpehaṃ, nibbinnā munivāṇinā’[munibhāṇinā (syā. pī.)].","thi-ap18:83.1":"Dutiyaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","thi-ap18:84.1":"“Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, tadāha sa mahīpati;","thi-ap18:84.3":"‘Anujānāmi te bhadde, pabbajjā tava sijjhatu’.","thi-ap18:85.1":"“Pabbajitvā tadā cāhaṃ, addhamāse [sattamāse (syā.)] upaṭṭhite;","thi-ap18:85.3":"Dīpodayañca bhedañca, disvā saṃviggamānasā.","thi-ap18:86.1":"“Nibbinnā sabbasaṅkhāre, paccayākārakovidā;","thi-ap18:86.3":"Caturoghe atikkamma, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap18:87.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī āsiṃ, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap18:87.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī cāpi bhavāmahaṃ.","thi-ap18:88.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap18:88.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap18:89.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap18:89.3":"Parisuddhaṃ mama ñāṇaṃ, uppannaṃ buddhasāsane.","thi-ap18:90.1":"“Kusalāhaṃ visuddhīsu, kathāvatthuvisāradā;","thi-ap18:90.3":"Abhidhammanayaññū ca, vasippattāmhi sāsane.","thi-ap18:91.1":"“Tato toraṇavatthusmiṃ, raññā kosalasāminā;","thi-ap18:91.3":"Pucchitā nipuṇe pañhe, byākarontī yathātathaṃ.","thi-ap18:92.1":"“Tadā sa rājā sugataṃ, upasaṅkamma pucchatha;","thi-ap18:92.3":"Tatheva buddho byākāsi, yathā te byākatā mayā.","thi-ap18:93.1":"“Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ;","thi-ap18:93.3":"Mahāpaññānamaggāti, bhikkhunīnaṃ naruttamo.","thi-ap18:94.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap18:95.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap18:96.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap18:97.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ khemā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap18:98.1":"Khemātheriyāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
